{"seq":4,"slug":"data-augmentation","title":"数据增强","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/feature-engineering/data-augmentation","wordCount":1041,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据增强\">数据增强</h1><h2 id=\"什么是数据增强\">什么是数据增强</h2><p>数据增强（Data Augmentation）是通过对现有数据进行变换来生成新训练样本的技术。它是解决数据不足和过拟合的有效手段，尤其在深度学习中几乎是标配。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;原始数据&lt;br/&gt;N 个样本&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;数据增强&lt;br/&gt;多种变换&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;增强数据&lt;br/&gt;k×N 个样本&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;更强的泛化能力&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;缓解过拟合&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;提升数据多样性&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"原始数据&lt;br/&gt;N 个样本\"] --&gt; B[\"数据增强&lt;br/&gt;多种变换\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"增强数据&lt;br/&gt;k×N 个样本\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"更强的泛化能力\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"缓解过拟合\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"提升数据多样性\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 数据增强应保持标签不变。增强后的样本应该仍然属于原始类别。例如，翻转一张猫的图片，它仍然是猫。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据增强围绕三个概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>标签保持（Label Invariance）</strong>：增强后的样本必须仍属原类别。这是不可违反的前提——翻转一张猫的图片它还是猫。违反此点就是在制造噪声而非数据。</li>\n<li><strong>不变性（Invariance）</strong>：增强想让模型对什么变换不敏感。旋转、裁剪、颜色抖动分别对应位置、尺度、光照的不变性；<strong>选择哪种增强，本质上是在告诉模型&quot;哪些变化不重要&quot;</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>过拟合与多样性</strong>：增强通过扩大样本多样性来缓解过拟合。这使它成为正则化家族的一员，与 Dropout 等方法互补而非替代。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者指向两条实务边界：<strong>保持标签</strong>划定了增强的合法范围（医学图像谨慎翻转），而<strong>不变性</strong>划定了有效性——如果变换改变了该任务里本该重要的信息，增强就会伤害模型。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"图像数据增强\">图像数据增强</h2><p>图像增强是最成熟的数据增强领域，通过几何变换和颜色变换来增加样本多样性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变换类型</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>几何变换</td>\n<td>翻转、旋转、裁剪</td>\n<td>改变空间位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>颜色变换</td>\n<td>亮度、对比度、饱和度</td>\n<td>改变视觉外观</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声注入</td>\n<td>高斯噪声、椒盐噪声</td>\n<td>增加鲁棒性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>擦除</td>\n<td>Random Erasing</td>\n<td>模拟遮挡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>Mixup、CutMix</td>\n<td>混合两个样本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;from torchvision import transforms&#10;&#10;train_transforms = transforms.Compose([&#10;    transforms.RandomResizedCrop(224, scale=(0.8, 1.0)),&#10;    transforms.RandomHorizontalFlip(p=0.5),&#10;    transforms.RandomRotation(degrees=15),&#10;    transforms.ColorJitter(&#10;        brightness=0.2, contrast=0.2,&#10;        saturation=0.2, hue=0.1&#10;    ),&#10;    transforms.RandomGrayscale(p=0.1),&#10;    transforms.ToTensor(),&#10;    transforms.Normalize(mean=[0.485, 0.456, 0.406],&#10;                        std=[0.229, 0.224, 0.225]),&#10;    transforms.RandomErasing(p=0.2),&#10;])&#10;&#10;test_transforms = transforms.Compose([&#10;    transforms.Resize(256),&#10;    transforms.CenterCrop(224),&#10;    transforms.ToTensor(),&#10;    transforms.Normalize(mean=[0.485, 0.456, 0.406],&#10;                        std=[0.229, 0.224, 0.225]),&#10;])&#10;&#10;print(&quot;训练增强管道:&quot;)&#10;for i, t in enumerate(train_transforms.transforms):&#10;    print(f&quot;  {i+1}. {t.__class__.__name__}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchvision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transforms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">train_transforms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transforms.Compose([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.RandomResizedCrop(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.RandomHorizontalFlip(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.RandomRotation(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">degrees</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.ColorJitter(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        brightness</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">contrast</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        saturation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.RandomGrayscale(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.ToTensor(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.Normalize(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.485</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.456</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.406</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                        std</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.229</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.225</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.RandomErasing(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">test_transforms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transforms.Compose([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.Resize(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.CenterCrop(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.ToTensor(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.Normalize(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.485</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.456</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.406</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                        std</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.229</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.225</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"训练增强管道:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(train_transforms.transforms):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">. </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__class__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__name__}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"mixup-与-cutmix\">Mixup 与 CutMix</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def mixup(x1, y1, x2, y2, alpha=0.2):&#10;    lam = np.random.beta(alpha, alpha)&#10;    x_mixed = lam * x1 + (1 - lam) * x2&#10;    y_mixed = lam * y1 + (1 - lam) * y2&#10;    return x_mixed, y_mixed&#10;&#10;x1 = torch.randn(3, 32, 32)&#10;x2 = torch.randn(3, 32, 32)&#10;y1 = torch.tensor([1.0, 0.0, 0.0])&#10;y2 = torch.tensor([0.0, 1.0, 0.0])&#10;&#10;x_mix, y_mix = mixup(x1, y1, x2, y2, alpha=0.2)&#10;print(f&quot;Mixup 标签: {y_mix.tolist()}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#